Math[1]","sourceString":"$k\\in\\mathbb R$，若$x^2+y^2-x+y+k=0$表示圆，求$k$范围。","latex":"x^2+y^2-x+y+k=0","status":"verified","decision":"keep"},{"id":"formula:review:L141:class1:b0:m2","location":"blocks[0].value.inlineMath[2]","sourceString":"$k\\in\\mathbb R$，若$x^2+y^2-x+y+k=0$表示圆，求$k$范围。","latex":"k","status":"verified","decision":"keep"},{"id":"formula:review:L141:class1:b1:m0","location":"blocks[1].value.inlineMath[0]","sourceString":"$k\\in(-\\infty,\\frac12)$。","latex":"k\\in(-\\infty,\\frac12)","status":"verified","decision":"keep"}]}],"requirements":{"knowledgeRequirement":{"value":"材料通过配方，以D²＋E²－4F的正、零、负分别判定一般式表示实圆、一个点或无实点图形。","originalWording":"我们知道直线的一般式方程是$ax+by+c=0$（$a$、$b$不同时为零）。\n下面来建立圆的一般方程。\n把圆的标准方程$(x-a)^2+(y-b)^2=r^2$展开并整理，可得\nx^2+y^2-2ax-2by+a^2+b^2-r^2=0.\n由此可见，任何一个圆的方程都可以写成下面的形式：\nx^2+y^2+Dx+Ey+F=0.\\qquad\\text{②}\n其中，$D$、$E$、$F$均为实常数。\n反过来，如果给定实常数$D$、$E$、$F$，方程②是否都表示一个圆呢？将方程②左边配方并整理，可得\n\\left(x+\\frac{D}{2}\\right)^2+\\left(y+\\frac{E}{2}\\right)^2=\\frac{D^2+E^2-4F}{4}.\n由此可以看出：\n（1）当$D^2+E^2-4F>0$时，方程②表示以$\\left(-\\frac{D}{2},-\\frac{E}{2}\\right)$为圆心，以$\\frac{\\sqrt{D^2+E^2-4F}}{2}$为半径的圆；\n（2）当$D^2+E^2-4F=0$时，方程②表示一个点$\\left(-\\frac{D}{2},-\\frac{E}{2}\\right)$；\n（3）当$D^2+E^2-4F<0$时，方程②没有实根，此时方程②不表示任何图形。\n因此，当$D^2+E^2-4F>0$时，方程②叫做圆的一般方程。\n$D^2+E^2-4F$可以称为方程②的判别式。","scope":"材料支持范围：平方项系数已归一且无xy项；只有判别量大于零才是非退化实圆。","status":"material_supported","sourceId":"TB-S1","sourceEdition":"既有已接收教材/教案材料；不是新增2025独立细点条文","evidence":[{"id":"ev:circle:TB-S1:p37-context","sourceId":"TB-S1","sourceSha256":"8ad39dc8a54c1052b614501cd03c1b5d2b8c9a00d417a61107d9d383b2580b19","locator":{"headingPath":["2 圆锥曲线","2.1 圆","3 圆的一般方程"],"part":"pdf","paragraphIndex":null,"tableIndex":null,"rowIndex":null,"cellIndex":null,"renderedPage":44,"printedPage":37,"equationObjectId":null},"quote":"我们知道直线的一般式方程是$ax+by+c=0$（$a$、$b$不同时为零）。","wordingChecked":true,"mathChecked":true,"mathSourceAsset":null,"rawMetadataRetainedInOriginalJson":true,"resource":{"url":"r80/assets/9f8ca62a1c908